tched people"},"count":"Count","download_report":"Download reports (CSV)","dry_run":"Dry-run","failed_title":"The import failed.","false":"No","finished_at":"Finished at","no_counts":"No records counted.","organization":"Organization","polling_hint":"This page refreshes automatically every 5 seconds while the import is running.","report_bucket":"Bucket","report_file":"File","report_rows":"Rows","reports_title":"Generated reports","started_at":"Started at","status":"Status:","statuses":{"awaiting_confirmation":"Awaiting confirmation","completed":"Completed","discarded":"Discarded","failed":"Failed","pending":"Pending","processing":"Processing"},"summary_title":"Summary per bucket","title":"DHO Import","true":"Yes","validation":{"column_person":"Person","column_score":"Similarity","column_status":"Status","column_user":"Correct user in the organization","confirm_button":"Confirm import","cycle_help":"Choose an existing organization cycle to receive the competency assessment list created in this import. Leave blank to link to no cycle.","cycle_section_title":"Link to a cycle (optional)","cycle_select_blank":"Do not link","discard_button":"Discard import","discard_confirm":"Are you sure you want to discard this import? The organization will be freed for a new import.","intro":"The dry-run finished. Review the people that did not match automatically, fix the matches you want and confirm to persist. You do not need to fix them all — fixing is optional.","people_empty":"No people pending review.","people_help":"For each person below, choose the correct user from the organization. The remaining people already matched automatically.","people_matched_count":"%{count} person(s) matched automatically.","people_section_title":"People that need review","readonly_help":"Competencies, feedbacks and 1:1s are not corrected row by row here. Download the CSVs to check the detail.","readonly_section_title":"Other blocks (read-only)","title":"Import validation","user_select_blank":"Keep 